{"4229620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crystal Harvest: Apex Operator", "steam_appid": 4229620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4750120], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack, mine, and sell valuable crystals as a hardened operator in this fast-paced incremental mining extraction roguelite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/2b21719d0094c982a88453870c8894eb.poster.avif?t=1785158787\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/2b21719d0094c982a88453870c8894eb.webm?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/2b21719d0094c982a88453870c8894eb.mp4?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each run lets you build powerful <strong>in-run upgrades</strong> that shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/a19ef78d6c23feab3c1ab625e1cf0d28.poster.avif?t=1785158787\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/a19ef78d6c23feab3c1ab625e1cf0d28.webm?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/a19ef78d6c23feab3c1ab625e1cf0d28.mp4?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earned currency fuels <strong>long-term, permanent progression</strong> through a deep upgrade tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/89b0f3224bd35bf39db5110e5acc839d.poster.avif?t=1785158787\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/89b0f3224bd35bf39db5110e5acc839d.webm?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/89b0f3224bd35bf39db5110e5acc839d.mp4?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast and intense, with varied alien enemies that constantly pressure your positioning, resource management, and build choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/c5f2afa6f67d25b07343cd5cdbf9ff4a.poster.avif?t=1785158787\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/c5f2afa6f67d25b07343cd5cdbf9ff4a.webm?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/c5f2afa6f67d25b07343cd5cdbf9ff4a.mp4?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll face Telkar alien creatures of all sizes, some spit, some slash, some stomp! From small, fast-moving worm-like organisms to massive, spider-like aliens that dominate the battlefield.  The Telkar are  actively trying to protect the crystals you are extracting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/5a6ce2bd52aee634c7a9e2f1cd63b8e9.poster.avif?t=1785158787\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/5a6ce2bd52aee634c7a9e2f1cd63b8e9.webm?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/5a6ce2bd52aee634c7a9e2f1cd63b8e9.mp4?t=1785158787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are split into distinct categories, allowing for diverse playstyles: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augmentations</strong> – Speed, dash abilities, oxygen efficiency, mobility upgrades and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> – Laser cooldowns and improvements, damage, grenades and mines, stuns, knockbacks, and various offensive modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense</strong> – Shields, health, armor, and various survivability boosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining</strong> – Backpack capacity, weight penalty reduction, deposit efficiency, and crystal handling, withdrawal upgrades and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robotics</strong> – Automated drills, mining and combat drones, turrets, spinning blades, and various  support machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong> – Airstrikes, bombing runs, chopper support, orbital assistance, mortars and much more.<br><br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every venture is a calculated gamble but with upgrades each run gets easier and better - until you become the ultimate crystal cracker!   </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack, mine, and sell valuable crystals as a hardened operator in this fast-paced incremental mining extraction roguelite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229620/extras/2b21719d0094c982a88453870c8894