=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> – Laser cooldowns and improvements, damage, grenades and mines, stuns, knockbacks, and various offensive modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense</strong> – Shields, health, armor, and various survivability boosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining</strong> – Backpack capacity, weight penalty reduction, deposit efficiency, and crystal handling, withdrawal upgrades and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robotics</strong> – Automated drills, mining and combat drones, turrets, spinning blades, and various  support machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong> – Airstrikes, bombing runs, chopper support, orbital assistance, mortars and much more.<br><br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every venture is a calculated gamble but with upgrades each run gets easier and better - until you become the ultimate crystal cracker!   </p>", "short_description": "Crack, mine, and sell mystical crystals while fighting alien hordes on various planets in this fast-paced incremental mining extraction roguelite hybrid experience. Earn currency to spend across upgrade categories with permanent progression and powerful builds in runs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Arabic, Bulgarian, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Malay, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Afrikaans, Albanian, Amharic, Armenian, Assamese, Azerbaijani, Bangla, Basque, Belarusian, Bosnian, Catalan, Cherokee, Croatian, Dari, Estonian, Filipino, Galician, Georgian, Gujarati, Hausa, Hebrew, Hindi, Icelandic, Igbo, Irish, K'iche', Kannada, Kazakh, Khmer, Kinyarwanda, Konkani, Kyrgyz, Latvian, Lithuanian, Luxembourgish, Mac